(32, 0, 9, 'Automatically passes all Panic test except of other skavenslaves', 'Expendable', 'Free upgrade'),
(33, 0, 9, 'If unit breaks from combat all unit within d6" suffers d3 s3 dmg from each rank left', 'Cornered rats', 'Free upgrade'),
