de'),\000d\000a(24, 0, 2, 'Free Heavy armors grants 5+ save', 'Heavy Armor', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(25, 0, 2, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day!) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(26, 0, 2, 'Grants More Ld for each rank (max 10Ld)', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a-- Skavenslaves\000d\000a(27, 4, 9, 'Champion', 'Champion', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(28, 2, 9, 'Musician', 'Musician', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(29, 0.5, 9, 'One more rank can attack', 'Spears', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(30, 0.5, 9, 'Slings', 'Slings', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(31, 0.5, 9, 'Shields grants 6+ save and 6+ ward save in front', 'Shield', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(32, 0, 9, 'Automatically passes all Panic test except of other skavenslaves', 'Expendable', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(33, 0, 9, 'If unit breaks from combat all unit within d6"" suffers d3 s3 dmg from each rank left', 'Cornered rats', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(34, 0, 9, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day!) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(35, 0, 9, 'Grants More Ld for each rank (max 10Ld)', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a-- Plague Priest\000d\000a(36, 0, 14, 'Grants One spell', 'Level 1 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(37, 35, 14, 'Grants One more spell', 'Level 2 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(38, 16, 14, 'All units around must pass Toughness test', 'Plague Censer', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(39, 4, 14, 'Grants +2 Strength in first turn of combat', 'Flail', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(40, 2, 14, 'Grants One more attack', 'Additional hand Weapon', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(41, 30, 14, 'Big rat on rat', 'Great Pox Rat', 'Mount'),\000d\000a(42, 150, 14, 'Plague Furnace', 'Plague Furnace', 'RARE'),\000d\000a(43, 200, 14, 'Hand Weapon', 'Hand Weapon', 'Free'),\000d\000a(44, 0, 14, 'Frenzy grants +1 attack', 'Frenzy', 'Free'),\000d\000a(45, 0, 14, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day!) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(46, 0, 14, 'Grants More Ld for each rank (max 10Ld)', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a\000d\000a-- Gutter Runners\000d\000a(48, 30, 13, 'Poisoned Wind Globadiers', 'Poisoned Wind Globadiers', 'SPECIAL'),\000d\000a(49, 30, 13, 'Warp-grinder', 'Warp-grinder', 'Weapon Team'),\000d\000a\000d\000a-- Plague Monks\000d\000a(50, 10, 3, 'Champion', 'Champion', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(51, 5, 3, 'Musician', 'Musician', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(52, 10, 3, 'Standard Bearer', 'Standard Bearer', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a\000d\000a-- Warlock Engineer\000d\000a(53, 0, 22, 'Grants One spell', 'Level 1 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(54, 35, 22, 'Grants One more spell', 'Level 2 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(55, 4, 22, 'Grants +2 Strength in first turn of combat', 'Flail', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(56, 2, 22, 'Grants One more attack', 'Additional hand Weapon', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(57, 10, 22, 'Add 10 points to attack', 'Warplock Pistol', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(58, 0, 22, 'Add armor save', 'Warp Armor', 'Armor'),\000d\000a(59, 15, 22, 'Add 15 points for a shield', 'Shield', 'Armor'),\000d\000a(60, 20, 22, 'Add 20 points for a Warplock Pistol', 'Warplock Pistol', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(61, 0, 22, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day!) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(62, 0, 22, 'Grants More Ld for each rank (max 10Ld)', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a-- GreySeer\000d\000a(63, 200, 10, 'Screaming Bell', 'Screaming Bell', 'Mount'),\000d\000a(64, 4, 10, 'Musician', 'Musician', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(65, 8, 10, 'Standard Bearer', 'Standard Bearer', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(66, 0.5, 10, 'Spears', 'Spears', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(67, 0.5, 10, 'Shields', 'Shields', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(68, 65, 10, 'Special Weapon Team', 'Poisoned Wind Mortar', 'Weapon Team'),\000d\000a(69, 70, 10, 'Special Weapon Team', 'Warp Fire Thrower', 'Weapon Team'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(70, 15, 10, 'A warpmusket is a rifle built along the same lines as the warplock jezzail, although not as long of barrel. A warpmusket isamove or fire weapon that has a range of 24"" and is Strength 5. A warpmusket is Armour Piercing, uses Unstable Ammunition (see page 65), and is a Warpstone Weapon.', 'Warpmusket', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(71, 15, 10, 'The fine powders and unctuous lotions purchased from Clan Eshin can turn a scratch into a deathblow. All close combat attacks made by the model count as Poisoned Attacks. This will affect a tail weapon, but not any magic weapons or a Rat Hound Bodyguard.', 'Poisoned Attacks', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(72, 8, 10, 'This could be a mechanical Clan Skryre attachment or an evolved mutation, the results are the same another appendage wielding a weapon. A model with this additional blade, spike or mace can make an additional S3 Attack at the user's WS and Initiative. It can be used in addition to other attacks including an additional hand weapon or even a magic weapon, although it gains no magical properties.', 'Tail Weapon', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(73, 8, 10, 'The puny pistols of other races pale in comparison to the Warlock Engineer's constructions. A warplock pistol follows the rules for pistols except that it has a range of 10"". A warplock pistol is Armour Piercing, uses Unstable Ammunition (see page 65), and is a Warpstone Weapon.', 'Warplock Pistol', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(74, 5, 10, 'There is a certain hound-like loyalty to these modified rats, although their verminous instincts means they might still attack their master if be appears vulnerable. A model with a Rat Hound upgrade can make an additional WS3. S3 attack. This attack is made at the owner's Initiative, however, on a To Hit roll of 1 the rat hound will instead inflict an automatic hit on its owner.', 'Rat Hound Bodyguard', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(75, 0, 10, 'A Grey Seer or Clan Skryre Warlock may consume warpstone to enhance magic. Before casting, declare tokens used. Each adds one dice to casting rolls, even beyond the normal limit. A spell may be cast entirely with warpstone. If a warpstone dice rolls a 1, the Wizard suffers a wound with no armour save. Miscasts and irresistible force apply as usual. When mixing normal and warpstone dice, roll separately or use different colours, green being traditional.', 'D3 Warpstone tokens', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a (76, 0, 10, 'Free hand weapons to fight', 'Hand Weapon', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(77, 0, 10, 'Grants 4 spells from Ruin or Plague Spells', 'Lvl 4 Wizzard', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(78, 0, 10, 'Skaven characters may refuse a challenge without loss of honour. While other races see this as cowardice, Skaven regard fleeing to safety and sacrificing followers as a leader[*]’s right. When refusing, the model moves to the back rank as usual, but the unit may still benefit from the character’s Leadership or Battle Standard ability even after he has been placed in the rear.', 'Verminous Valour', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(79, 0, 10, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day!) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(80, 0, 10, 'Skaven are not brave, but gain courage from numbers. With Strength in Numbers, a unit adds its rank bonus to Leadership for tests, to a maximum of 10. For example, Clanrats with Ld 5 in three ranks get +2, for Ld 7. A Chieftain raises this to 8, a nearby Warlord (Ld 7) to 9. The General gives only his base Leadership, not his unit’s bonus. If a unit loses rank bonus, it also loses the Leadership bonus, such as when fleeing.', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule');"
