(31, 0.5, 9, 'Shields grants 6+ save and 6+ ward save in front', 'Shield', 'Weapon'),
(32, 0, 9, 'Automatically passes all Panic test except of other skavenslaves', 'Expendable', 'Free upgrade'),
(33, 0, 9, 'If unit breaks from combat all unit within d6 range suffers d3 s3 dmg from each rank left', 'Cornered rats', 'Free upgrade'),
(34, 0, 9, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),
