(79, 0, 10, 'Skaven are not brave, but gain courage from numbers. With Strength in Numbers, a unit adds its rank bonus to Leadership for tests, to a maximum of 10. For example, Clanrats with Ld 5 in three ranks get +2, for Ld 7. A Chieftain raises this to 8, a nearby Warlord (Ld 7) to 9. The General gives only his base Leadership, not his unit’s bonus. If a unit loses rank bonus, it also loses the Leadership bonus, such as when fleeing.', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule') [22001-232]
