(76, 0, 10, 'Grants 4 spells from Ruin or Plague Spells', 'Lvl 4 Wizzard', 'Free upgrade'),
(77, 0, 10, 'Skaven may refuse a challenge without losing honour. Fleeing to safety is a leader’s right. Model moves to back rank but the unit still benefits from its Leadership or Battle Standard ability.', 'Verminous Valour', 'Free upgrade'),
(78, 0, 10, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),
(79, 0, 10, 'Skaven gain courage from numbers. With Strength in Numbers, a unit adds its rank bonus to Leadership (max 10). Losing rank bonus also loses Leadership bonus. Example: Clanrats Ld 5 in 3 ranks get +2.', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule') [42001-232]
