rd of Might', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(446, 15, 14, '+1 Attack', 'Gold Sigil Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(447, 15, 14, 'Attacks made by this sword are made at Initiative 10', 'Sword of Striking', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(448, 15, 14, 'Attacks made with the Sword of Striking receive a +1 bonus to hit.', 'Sword of Striking', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(449, 10, 14, 'Close combat attacks made by the Biting Blade are armour piercing.', 'Bitting Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(450, 10, 14, 'Attacks made with the Relic Sword will always wound on a 5+, unless they would normally need a lower result.', 'Relic Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(451, 10, 14, 'The bearer causes Fear', 'Shrieking Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(452, 5, 14, 'A monster or character that suffers an unsaved wound from the Tormentor sword has the Stupidity special rule for the rest of the game.', 'Tormentor Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(453, 5, 14, 'A monster or character that suffers unsaved wounds from Warrior Bane permanently loses one Attack for each unsaved wound (to a minimum of Attacks 1).', 'Warriors Bane', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(454, 50, 14, 'The Armour of Destiny grants the Heavy armour. The Armour wearer a 4+ ward save.', 'Armour of Destiny', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(455, 50, 14, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. Any successful roll to wound made against the wound made against the wearer of the Trickster's Helm must be re-rolled.', 'Tricksters helm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(456, 45, 14, 'Armour of Silvered Steel grants its wearer a 2+ armour save that cannot be improved by any means.', 'Armour of Silvered Steel', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(457, 35, 14, 'Heavy armour. The Armour of Fortune grants the wearer a 5+ ward save.', 'Armour of Fortune', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(458, 30, 14, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. p502 rulebook', 'Helm of Discord', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(459, 25, 14, 'Light armour: Enemies suffer a-1 to hit penalty when attempting', 'Glittering Scales', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(460, 25, 14, 'Shield. The bearer has +1 armour save against the shooting attacks', 'Shield of Ptolos', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(461, 20, 14, 'Shield. The bearer gains Magic Resistance(1)', 'Spellshield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(462, 20, 14, 'Heavy Armour The Armour grants the wearer a 6+ ward save', 'Gamblers Armour', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(463, 10, 14, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. The wearer has a 2+ ward save against flaming ', 'Dragonhelm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(464, 5, 14, 'Shield. The bearer counts his armour save as being two points higher than normal, rather than the it ur than the usual one point that a shield would normally grant', 'Enchanted Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(465, 5, 14, 'Shield. One use only. The first hit suffered by the bearer of the Charmed Sield is discounted on a roll of 2+.', 'Charmed Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(466, 45, 14, '4+ ward save', 'Talisman of Preservation', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(467, 45, 14, 'Grants Magic resistance(3)', 'Obsidian Lodestone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(468, 30, 14, '5+ ward save', 'Talisman of Endurance', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(469, 30, 14, 'Grants Magic resistance(2)', 'Obsidian Amulet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(470, 30, 14, 'The bearer re-rolls failed armour saves', 'Dawn Stone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(471, 15, 14, 'One use only +4 ward save against the first wound suffered by bearer p503 rulebook', 'Opal Amulet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(472, 15, 14, 'Grants Magic resistance(1)', 'Obsidian Trinket', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(473, 10, 14, 'The bearer has regeneration(6+) special rule', 'Seed of rebirth', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(474, 5, 14, 'The bearer of the Dragonbane Gem has a 2+ ward save against flaming attacks.', 'Dragonbane gem', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(475, 5, 14, 'This item grants grants the bearer a 5+ ward save against wounds caused in close combat by models that have the Fly special ', 'Pidgeon Plucker Pendant', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(476, 5, 14, 'One Use Only The luck stone allows the bearer to re-roll failed armour save', 'Luckstone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(477, 70, 14, 'The bearer receives a +1 bonus on attempts to cast and dispel.', 'Book of Ashur', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(478, 50, 14, '(One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. After it resolves, roll 1D6 for each casting die — the caster suffers 1 wound on each 5+, no armour saves allowed.', 'Feedback Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(479, 50, 14, 'Scroll of Leeching (One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. After it resolves, add dispel dice equal to the number of casting dice (max pool 12).', 'Scroll of Leeching', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(480, 50, 14, 'Hex Scroll (One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. Caster tests D6 ≤ Wizard level or is turned into a toad: no spells, no items, stats 1 (Wounds unchanged). At each magic phase, roll 4+ to return.', 'Sivjirs Hex Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(481, 35, 14, 'One use only. A Power Scroll can be used when the Wizard makes a casting attempt. During that casting attempt, any roll of a double will cause irresistible force (and a miscast).', 'Power Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(482, 35, 14, 'One use only. The bearer can increase one of his casting results by an additional +D6, after other casting dice have been rolled. This extra power dice can contribute to casting a spell with irresistible force (and a miscast).', 'Wand of Jet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(483, 35, 14, 'One Use only adds +D6 dice to the power pool at the start of the casters own magic phase, but also inflicts D3 wounds on the bearer (with no armour saves allowed).', 'Forbiden Rod', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(484, 25, 14, 'Feedback effect item (One use): At the start of your magic phase, activate. For that phase, each time an enemy wizard dispels the bearers spell, roll a D6"
