attle.', 'Healing potion', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(495, 35, 14, 'Flying creatures (and their riders) must re-roll successful rolls to hit against the bearer (and any unit he is with) in close combat.', 'Featherfoe Torc', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(496, 25, 14, 'Bound spell (power level 3). The Ruby Ring of Ruin contains the Fireball spell (see the Lore of Fire).', 'Ruby Ring of Ruin', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(497, 25, 14, 'The wearer of this mask causes Terror. However, other models can never use his Leadership', 'The Terrifying Mask of EEE!', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(498, 20, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Strength can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Strength until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Strenght', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(499, 20, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Toughness can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Tougness until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Toughness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(500, 15, 14, 'Models in base contact with the bearer (friends and foes) must re-roll successful ward saves.', 'The other tricksters shard', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(501, 5, 14, 'The character (and any unit he is with) gain a 6+ ward save against war machine weapons.', 'Ironcurse icon', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(502, 5, 14, '(One use): Drink at the start of any player’s turn. The user gains Immune to Psychology and Devastating Charge until the end of that turn.', 'Potion of Foolhardiness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(503, 5, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Speed can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 Initiative until the end of the turn.', 'Potion of Speed', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a/* Gutter Runners */\000d\000a\000d\000a(504, 0, 13, 'Enemy suffer -1 WS', 'Snare-net', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(505, 1, 13, '24range', 'Slings', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(506, 5, 13, 'Model with the Poisoned Attacks special rule wounds his target automatically if his natural dice roll to hit is a 6. Armour saves are modified by the Strength of the attack as normal. Note that if a Poisoned shooting attack needs to roll a 7 or more to hit, or hits automatically, then the Poisoned attacks rule does not come into play.', 'Poisoned attacks', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(507, 12, 13, '24range', 'Deathrunner', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(508, 10, 13, 'p109', 'Smokebombs', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(509, 30, 13, 'd3 wound armour piercing ', 'Weepingblade', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(510, 60, 13, 'Warp-grinder', 'Warp-grinder', 'Weapon Team'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(511, 0, 13, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(512, 0, 13, 'Check ', 'Skirmish', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(513, 0, 13, 'Check', 'Scouts', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(514, 0, 13, 'Check', 'Sneaky Infiltrators', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(515, 0, 13, 'Ward save', 'Dodge 6+ / Deathrunner 5+', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(516, 0, 13, '+1 attack', 'Two handed weapons', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a(517, 0, 13, 'range weapon', 'Throwing stars', 'Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a/* Plague Monks */\000d\000a(518, 10, 3, 'Champion', 'Bringer-of-the-Word', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(519, 5, 3, 'Musician', 'Musician', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(520, 10, 3, 'Standard Bearer', 'Standard Bearer', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(521, 10, 3, 'Add Magic standard', 'Magic Standard Bearer', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(522, 0, 3, '+1 attack', 'Frenzy', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(523, 0, 3, '+1 attack', 'Two hand weapon', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a(524, 0, 3, '+1 attack', 'Frenzy', 'SingleBuy'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(525, 30, 3, 'One use only re-roll all failed to hit and to wound hits', 'Plague Banner', 'Magic Banner'),\000d\000a(526, 70, 3, 'All enemy within 12inches suffer -1 ld and owner can force enemy in base contact to re roll succesffull ld test', 'Sacred Banner of the 