 in models with the Fly special ', 'Scarecrow Banner', 'Magic Banner'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(542, 10, 3, 'One use only can march as 3x speed but suffer 2d6 S3 hits', 'Banner of Verminous Scurring', 'Magic Banner'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(543, 0, 3, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(544, 0, 3, 'Skaven gain courage from numbers. With Strength in Numbers, a unit adds its rank bonus to Leadership (max 10). Losing rank bonus also loses Leadership bonus. Example: Clanrats Ld 5 in 3 ranks get +2.', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a/* Warlock Eng */\000d\000a(545, 0, 22, 'Grants One spell', 'Level 1 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(546, 35, 22, 'Grants One more spell', 'Level 2 Wizard', 'Magic'),\000d\000a(547, 0, 22, 'Free Weapons to fight', 'Hand Weapon', 'Magic'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(548, 0, 22, 'Skaven may refuse a challenge without losing honour. Fleeing to safety is a leaders right. Model moves to back rank but the unit still benefits from its Leadership or Battle Standard ability.', 'Verminous Valour', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(549, 0, 22, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(550, 0, 22, 'Grants More Ld for each rank (max 10Ld)', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(551, 15, 22, 'Warpmusket: a rifle like a warplock jezzail. Range 24 inches, Strength 5, Armour Piercing, uses Unstable Ammunition. Can move or fire. Warpstone Weapon.', 'Warpmusket', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(552, 15, 22, 'Poisoned Attacks: all close combat attacks by this model are Poisoned. Affects tail weapons but not magic weapons or Rat Hound Bodyguard.', 'Poisoned Attacks', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(553, 8, 22, 'Tail Weapon: an extra appendage wielding a blade, spike, or mace. Grants 1 additional S3 attack at the models WS and Initiative, usable with other attacks, but has no magical properties.', 'Tail Weapon', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(554, 8, 22, 'Warplock Pistol: range 10in, Armour Piercing, uses Unstable Ammunition, Warpstone Weapon. Superior to other races pistols.', 'Warplock Pistol', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a(555, 5, 22, 'Rat Hound upgrade grants an extra WS3/S3 attack at the owners Initiative. On a To Hit roll of 1, the hound hits its owner. Despite loyalty, verminous instincts may make it attack if the master seems vulnerable.', 'Rat Hound Bodyguard', 'The Scavenge-Pile'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(556, 30, 22, 'Magic Weapon +1 to hit', 'Sword of Striking', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(557, 25, 22, 'Magic Weapon +1 to Attack', 'Sword of Battle', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(558, 20, 22, 'Magic Weapon +1 to Strength', 'Sword of Might', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(559, 5, 22, 'Magic Weapon -1 to armour save', 'Bitting Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(560, 5, 22, 'Magic armour 5+ armour save', 'Enchanted Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(561, 5, 22, 'Talisman grants 6+ ward save', 'Talisman of Protection', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(562, 25, 22, 'One Use Only Automatically Dispel an enemy Spell', 'Dispell Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(563, 20, 22, 'One Use Only grants +2  dice to Cast a spell', 'Power Stone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(564, 35, 22, 'Arcane +1 to dispell', 'Staff of Sorcerry', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(565, 100, 22, 'Str 10 enemy must reroll all succes ward saves, any unsaved roll is multiplied to d6. Roll d6 at any end of weilder turn 3+ nothing happens, 1-2 user takes wound without armour save allowed', 'Fellblade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(566, 50, 22, 'Armour saves cannont be taken against this sword', 'Warpforged Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(567, 45, 22, '+1 Str +1 Attack', 'Warlock-A