e casters own magic phase, but also inflicts D3 wounds on the bearer (with no armour saves allowed).', 'Forbiden Rod', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(637, 25, 22, 'Feedback effect item (One use): At the start of your magic phase, activate. For that phase, each time an enemy wizard dispels the bearers spell, roll a D6"; SQL statement:
