l d6 at any end of weilder turn 3+ nothing happens, 1-2 user takes wound without armour save allowed', 'Fellblade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(673, 50, 20, 'Armour saves cannont be taken against this sword', 'Warpforged Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(674, 45, 20, '+1 Str +1 Attack', 'Warlock-Augumented Weapon', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(675, 35, 20, '+1 Str any unsaved Wound is multipled to 2,If wielder makes a hit roll that has two or more rolls of 1 the wielder suffers wound that is multipled to 2', 'Blade of Corruption', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(676, 30, 20, 'Has armour piercing each unsaved wound is multipled to d3', 'Weeping Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(677, 25, 20, '+1 Str to all attacks in close combat Agains Dwarfs grants armour piercing and re-rolls all failed to Wound rolls', 'Dwarfbane', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(678, 10, 20, 'Enemy lose 1 T of every wound taken if his T = 0 he dies', 'Blade of Nurglitch', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(679, 30, 20, 'Grants 4+ save, all succes armour saves armour inflicts S4 hit against the model that struckt the blow', 'Warpstone armour', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(680, 25, 20, 'Grants 4+ save, first succesfull wound Destroys the armour and wound is discounted ', 'Worlds Edge Armour', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(681, 15, 20, 'Any model in base contact suffer -1 attack (minimum 1 attack) to strike shield bearer', 'Shield of Distraction', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(682, 30, 20, 'ward save 5+', 'Foul Pendant', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(683, 15, 20, 'One Use Only A Skaven model can make a single enemy in game in base contact to re roll all its successful to hit dice rolls', 'Rival hide talisman', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(684, 50, 20, 'A character carrying can force Clanrats of Stormvermin to drink roll d6 - 1 gone bad the unit takes d6  s3 hits , 2-3 the units has hatred of all enemies, 4-5 Frienzied units has frenzy, 6 rabid grants +2 attacks per unit and d6 automatics hits per turn', 'Skavenbrew', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(685, 30, 20, 'One use only instantly cure all wound ( use only on begin of any phase)', 'Skalm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(686, 25, 20, 'Enemy have to pass ld test when they want to charge this unit', 'Pipes of piebald', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(687, 20, 20, '-1 ld to enemy in base contact with units', 'Proteins of verminous doom', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(688, 50, 20, '3x Multiple shots S5 multiple d3 wounds', 'Warpstone stars', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(689, 30, 20, 'Read in army book p109', 'Infernal Bomb', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(690, 30, 20, 'p109 army book', 'Smoke bombs', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(691, 50, 20, 'One Use Only p110', 'Brass Orb', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(692, 30, 20, 'p110', 'Doomrocket', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(693, 25, 20, 'Any model touched by throw suffer 4+ hit without armour save allowed p110 ', 'Death globe', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(694, 20, 20, '+1 Bs no penalties of covers', 'Warlock Optics', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(695, 35, 20, 'One use Only bound spell (lvl 5) 24inches range. Spell inflicts S2 hit on every model in unit with no armour save allowed', 'Warp scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(696, 60, 20, '+3 Str p501 rulebook', 'Giant Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(697, 60, 20, '+3 Attacks p501 rulebook', 'Sword of Bloodshed', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(698, 40, 20, 'Armour saves cannont be taken against wounds caused by Obsidian Blade', 'Obsidian Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(699, 40, 20, '+2 Str', 'Ogre Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(700, 40, 20, '+2 Attacks made by this sword in close combat', 'Sword of Strife', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(701, 35, 20, 'Paired weapons. The bearer has Weapon skill 10', 'Fencers Blades', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(702, 30, 20, 'The bearer has +1 Str and +1 for every enemy in base contact p501 rulebook', 'Sword of Anti-heroes', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(703, 25, 20, 'A Wizard that suffers unsaved  wounds  from  the Spellthieving Sword loses one 