stantly cure all wound ( use only on begin of any phase)', 'Skalm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(686, 25, 20, 'Enemy have to pass ld test when they want to charge this unit', 'Pipes of piebald', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(687, 20, 20, '-1 ld to enemy in base contact with units', 'Proteins of verminous doom', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(688, 50, 20, '3x Multiple shots S5 multiple d3 wounds', 'Warpstone stars', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(689, 30, 20, 'Read in army book p109', 'Infernal Bomb', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(690, 30, 20, 'p109 army book', 'Smoke bombs', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(691, 50, 20, 'One Use Only p110', 'Brass Orb', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(692, 30, 20, 'p110', 'Doomrocket', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(693, 25, 20, 'Any model touched by throw suffer 4+ hit without armour save allowed p110 ', 'Death globe', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(694, 20, 20, '+1 Bs no penalties of covers', 'Warlock Optics', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(695, 35, 20, 'One use Only bound spell (lvl 5) 24inches range. Spell inflicts S2 hit on every model in unit with no armour save allowed', 'Warp scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(696, 60, 20, '+3 Str p501 rulebook', 'Giant Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(697, 60, 20, '+3 Attacks p501 rulebook', 'Sword of Bloodshed', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(698, 40, 20, 'Armour saves cannont be taken against wounds caused by Obsidian Blade', 'Obsidian Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(699, 40, 20, '+2 Str', 'Ogre Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(700, 40, 20, '+2 Attacks made by this sword in close combat', 'Sword of Strife', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(701, 35, 20, 'Paired weapons. The bearer has Weapon skill 10', 'Fencers Blades', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(702, 30, 20, 'The bearer has +1 Str and +1 for every enemy in base contact p501 rulebook', 'Sword of Anti-heroes', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(703, 25, 20, 'A Wizard that suffers unsaved  wounds  from  the Spellthieving Sword loses one of his spell (determined randomly) for each unsaved wound.', 'Spellthieving Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(704, 25, 20, 'Always Strikes First special rule.', 'Sword of Swift Slaying', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(705, 20, 20, '+1 Attack', 'Sword of Battle', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(706, 20, 20, 'The bearer has the Frenzy special rule and can never lose his Frenzy', 'Berseker Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(707, 20, 20, 'Close combat attacks made with this sword are resolved at +1 Strength.', 'Sword of Might', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(708, 15, 20, '+1 Attack', 'Gold Sigil Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(709, 15, 20, 'Attacks made by this sword are made at Initiative 10', 'Sword of Striking', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(710, 15, 20, 'Attacks made with the Sword of Striking receive a +1 bonus to hit.', 'Sword of Striking', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(711, 10, 20, 'Close combat attacks made by the Biting Blade are armour piercing.', 'Bitting Blade', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(712, 10, 20, 'Attacks made with the Relic Sword will always wound on a 5+, unless they would normally need a lower result.', 'Relic Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(713, 10, 20, 'The bearer causes Fear', 'Shrieking Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(714, 5, 20, 'A monster or character that suffers an unsaved wound from the Tormentor sword has the Stupidity special rule for the rest of the game.', 'Tormentor Sword', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(715, 5, 20, 'A monster or character that suffers unsaved wounds from Warrior Bane permanently loses one Attack for each unsaved wound (to a minimum of Attacks 1).', 'Warriors Bane', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(716, 50, 20, 'The Armour of Destiny grants the Heavy armour. The Armour wearer a 4+ ward save.', 'Armour of Destiny', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(717, 50, 20, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. Any successful roll to wound made against the wound made against the wearer of the Trickster's Helm must be re-rolled.', 'Tricksters helm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(718, 45, 20, 'Armour of Silvered Steel grants its wearer a 2+ armour save that cannot be improved by any means.', 'Armour of Silvered Steel', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(719, 35, 20, 'Heavy armour. The Armour of Fortune grants the wearer a 5+ ward save.', 'Armour of Fortune', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(720, 30, 20, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. p502 rulebook', 'Helm of Discord', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(721, 25, 20, 'Light armour: Enemies suffer a-1 to hit penalty when attempting', 'Glittering Scales', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(722, 25, 20, 'Shield. The bearer has +1 armour save against the shooting attacks', 'Shield of Ptolos', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(723, 20, 20, 'Shield. The bearer gains Magic Resistance(1)', 'Spellshield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(724, 20, 20, 'Heavy Armour The Armour grants the wearer a 6+ ward save', 'Gamblers Armour', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(725, 10, 20, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. The wearer has a 2+ ward save against flaming ', 'Dragonhelm', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(726, 5, 20, 'Shield. The bearer counts his armour save as being two points higher than normal, rather than the it ur than the usual one point that a shield would normally grant', 'Enchanted Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(727, 5, 20, 'Shield. One use only. The first hit suffered by the bearer of the Charmed Sield is discounted on a roll of 2+.', 'Charmed Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(728, 45, 20, '4+ ward save', 'Talisman of Preservation', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(729, 45, 20, 'Grants Magic resistance(3)', 'Obsidian Lodestone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(730, 30, 20, '5+ ward save', 'Talisman of Endurance', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(731, 30, 20, 'Grants Magic resistance(2)', 'Obsidian Amulet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(732, 30, 20, 'The bearer re-rolls failed armour saves', 'Dawn Stone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(733, 15, 20, 'One use only +4 ward save against the first wound suffered by bearer p503 rulebook', 'Opal Amulet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(734, 15, 20, 'Grants Magic resistance(1)', 'Obsidian Trinket', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(735, 10, 20, 'The bearer has regeneration(6+) special rule', 'Seed of rebirth', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(736, 5, 20, 'The bearer of the Dragonbane Gem has a 2+ ward save against flaming attacks.', 'Dragonbane gem', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(737, 5, 20, 'This item grants grants the bearer a 5+ ward save against wounds caused in close combat by models that have the Fly special ', 'Pidgeon Plucker Pendant', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(738, 5, 20, 'One Use Only The luck stone allows the bearer to re-roll failed armour save', 'Luckstone', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(739, 70, 20, 'The bearer receives a +1 bonus on attempts to cast and dispel.', 'Book of Ashur', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(740, 50, 20, '(One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. After it resolves, roll 1D6 for each casting die — the caster suffers 1 wound on each 5+, no armour saves allowed.', 'Feedback Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(741, 50, 20, 'Scroll of Leeching (One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. After it resolves, add dispel dice equal to the number of casting dice (max pool 12).', 'Scroll of Leeching', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(742, 50, 20, 'Hex Scroll (One use): Instead of dispelling, let the spell be cast. Caster tests D6 ≤ Wizard level or is turned into a toad: no spells, no items, stats 1 (Wounds unchanged). At each magic phase, roll 4+ to return.', 'Sivjirs Hex Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(743, 35, 20, 'One use only. A Power Scroll can be used when the Wizard makes a casting attempt. During that casting attempt, any roll of a double will cause irresistible force (and a miscast).', 'Power Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(744, 35, 20, 'One use only. The bearer can increase one of his casting results by an additional +D6, after other casting dice have been rolled. This extra power dice can contribute to casting a spell with irresistible force (and a miscast).', 'Wand of Jet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(745, 35, 20, 'One Use only adds +D6 dice to the power pool at the start of the casters own magic phase, but also inflicts D3 wounds on the bearer (with no armour saves allowed).', 'Forbiden Rod', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(746, 25, 20, 'Feedback effect item (One use): At the start of your magic phase, activate. For that phase, each time an enemy wizard dispels the bearers spell, roll a D6; on 5+, that wizard suffers a wound with no armour save.', 'Tricksters shard', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(747, 25, 20, 'One use only. If the wizard rolls on the miscast table he can re-roll the result.', 'Earthing Rod', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(748, 20, 20, '(One use): Before casting, the wizard may add 2 extra dice to the casting roll (at least 1 die must still come from the power pool).', 'Power Scroll', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(749, 15, 20, '(One use): After rolling dispel dice, the bearer may add +D6 to a single dispel attempt. This bonus can contribute to an Irresistible Dispel.', 'Scetre of Stability', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(750, 15, 20, 'The Wizard adds +1 to all of his channeling attempts.', 'Channeling staff', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(751, 15, 20, '(One use): After an enemy spell is cast, the bearer may use this scroll. The spell is resolved normally, but its target gains a 4+ ward save against any wounds it causes.', 'Scroll of Shielding', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a(752, 100, 20, 'The wearer is treated as being a Level 2 Wizard who can use a randomly chosen spell lore. However, he also has the Stupidity special ', 'Wizzard Hat', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(753, 100, 20, '(One use): After deployment zones are set but before armies are deployed, place a Watchtower-sized building in your deployment zone. Treated as a standard building. If no model is available, it cannot be used.', 'Fozzirks Folding Fortess', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(754, 50, 20, 'Infantry or monstrous infantry models on foot only. The owner of this magical carpet has the Fly special rule. However, he cannot join units. ', 'Arabyan Carpet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(755, 35, 20, 'The bearer of the Crown of Command has the Stubborn special rule.', 'Crown of Command', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(756, 35, 20, 'One use only. The Healing Potion can be drunk at the start of the controlling player's turn. Immediately recovers D6 Wounds lost in the battle.', 'Healing potion', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(757, 35, 20, 'Flying creatures (and their riders) must re-roll successful rolls to hit against the bearer (and any unit he is with) in close combat.', 'Featherfoe Torc', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(758, 25, 20, 'Bound spell (power level 3). The Ruby Ring of Ruin contains the Fireball spell (see the Lore of Fire).', 'Ruby Ring of Ruin', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(759, 25, 20, 'The wearer of this mask causes Terror. However, other models can never use his Leadership', 'The Terrifying Mask of EEE[*]!', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(760, 20, 20, 'One use only. The Potion of Strength can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Strength until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Strenght', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(761, 20, 20, 'One use only. The Potion of Toughness can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Tougness until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Toughness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(762, 15, 20, 'Models in base contact with the bearer (friends and foes) must re-roll successful ward saves.', 'The other tricksters shard', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(763, 5, 20, 'The character (and any unit he is with) gain a 6+ ward save against war machine weapons.', 'Ironcurse icon', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(764, 5, 20, '(One use): Drink at the start of any player’s turn. The user gains Immune to Psychology and Devastating Charge until the end of that turn.', 'Potion of Foolhardiness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(765, 5, 20, 'One use only. The Potion of Speed can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 Initiative until the end of the turn.', 'Potion of Speed', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a\000d\000a\000d\000a(766, 0, 20, 'A Grey Seer or Clan Skryre Warlock may use warpstone to boost magic. Declare tokens before casting; each adds a dice. Spells can use only warpstone. A 1 causes a wound. Miscasts and irresistible force apply as usual.', 'D3 Warpstone tokens', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(767, 0, 20, 'Free hand weapons to fight', 'Hand Weapon', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(768, 0, 20, 'Grants 4 spells from Ruin or Plague Spells', 'Lvl 4 Wizzard', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(769, 0, 20, 'Skaven may refuse a challenge without losing honour. Fleeing to safety is a leaders right. Model moves to back rank but the unit still benefits from its Leadership or Battle Standard ability.', 'Verminous Valour', 'Free upgrade'),\000d\000a(770, 0, 20, 'The Skaven embody the adage (he who runs away lives to fight another day) All models in the Skaven army add add +1 to the total rolled to determine the distance they flee.', 'Scurry Away', 'Race special rule'),\000d\000a(771, 0, 20, 'Skaven gain courage from numbers. With Strength in Numbers, a unit adds its rank bonus to Leadership (max 10). Losing rank bonus also loses Leadership bonus. Example: Clanrats Ld 5 in 3 ranks get +2.', 'Strength in numbers', 'Race special rule')"; SQL statement:
