(683, 15, 20, 'One Use Only A Skaven model can make a single enemy in game in base contact to re roll all its successful to hit dice rolls', 'Rival hide talisman', 'Magic Weapon'),
(684, 50, 20, 'A character carrying can force Clanrats of Stormvermin to drink roll d6 - 1 gone bad the unit takes d6  s3 hits , 2-3 the units has hatred of all enemies, 4-5 Frienzied units has frenzy, 6 rabid grants +2 attacks per unit and d6 automatics hits per turn', 'Skavenbrew', 'Magic Weapon'),
