(219, 10, 21, 'The wearer counts his armour save as being one point higher than normal. The wearer has a 2+ ward save against flaming ', 'Dragonhelm', 'Magic Weapon'),
(220, 5, 21, 'Shield. The bearer counts his armour save as being two points higher than normal, rather than the it ur than the usual one point that a shield would normally grant', 'Enchanted Shield', 'Magic Weapon'),
(221, 5, 21, 'Shield. One use only. The first hit suffered by the bearer of the Charmed Sield is discounted on a roll of 2+.', 'Charmed Shield', 'Magic Weapon'); [42000-232]
