org.h2.jdbc.JdbcSQLSyntaxErrorException: Błąd składniowy w wyrażeniu SQL "INSERT INTO UPGRADE (ID, POINTS_COST, UNIT_ID, DESCRIPTION, NAME, UPGRADE_TYPE) VALUES\000d\000a\000d\000a(490, 100, 14, 'The wearer is treated as being a Level 2 Wizard who can use a randomly chosen spell lore. However, he also has the Stupidity special ', 'Wizzard Hat', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(491, 100, 14, '(One use): After deployment zones are set but before armies are deployed, place a Watchtower-sized building in your deployment zone. Treated as a standard building. If no model is available, it cannot be used.', 'Fozzirks Folding Fortess', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(492, 50, 14, 'Infantry or monstrous infantry models on foot only. The owner of this magical carpet has the Fly special rule. However, he cannot join units. ', 'Arabyan Carpet', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(493, 35, 14, 'The bearer of the Crown of Command has the Stubborn special rule.', 'Crown of Command', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(494, 35, 14, 'One use only. The Healing Potion can be drunk at the start of the controlling player's turn. Immediately recovers D6 Wounds lost in the battle.', 'Healing potion', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(495, 35, 14, 'Flying creatures (and their riders) must re-roll successful rolls to hit against the bearer (and any unit he is with) in close combat.', 'Featherfoe Torc', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(496, 25, 14, 'Bound spell (power level 3). The Ruby Ring of Ruin contains the Fireball spell (see the Lore of Fire).', 'Ruby Ring of Ruin', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(497, 25, 14, 'The wearer of this mask causes Terror. However, other models can never use his Leadership', 'The Terrifying Mask of EEE[*]!', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(498, 20, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Strength can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Strength until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Strenght', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(499, 20, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Toughness can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 The imbiber Tougness until the end of the turn', 'Potion of Toughness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(500, 15, 14, 'Models in base contact with the bearer (friends and foes) must re-roll successful ward saves.', 'The other tricksters shard', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(501, 5, 14, 'The character (and any unit he is with) gain a 6+ ward save against war machine weapons.', 'Ironcurse icon', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(502, 5, 14, '(One use): Drink at the start of any player’s turn. The user gains Immune to Psychology and Devastating Charge until the end of that turn.', 'Potion of Foolhardiness', 'Magic Weapon'),\000d\000a(503, 5, 14, 'One use only. The Potion of Speed can be drunk at the start of any player's turn. The imbiber has +3 Initiative until the end of the turn.', 'Potion of Speed', 'Magic Weapon')"
